<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- Created for the Irish Payroll module (com.blueseer.pay). Matches Thesaurus
     Payroll Manager 2026's documented "2 per page (Low Resolution)" payslip
     type (thesaurus.ie/docs/2026/distributing-payslips/printing-payslips/):
     plain black-and-white, two payslips per A4 sheet - same content and field
     set as payslip_2perpage_hires.jrxml, with the colour fill and accent
     rule removed so it renders cleanly on a monochrome printer.

     JasperReports 7.x JRXML syntax (see payslip_2perpage_hires.jrxml's header
     comment for the 6.x -> 7.x rationale). -->
